WEBVTT

00:14:59.845 --> 00:15:02.786
of how young professionals
navigate career transitions.

00:15:02.810 --> 00:15:05.666
She didn't start out
focusing on authenticity,

00:15:05.690 --> 00:15:07.981
but she quickly saw
that for the participants,

00:15:08.005 --> 00:15:10.496
finding their authentic selves
was a big challenge.

00:15:10.520 --> 00:15:15.196
HI: That was a study of how
young consultants and investment bankers

00:15:15.220 --> 00:15:20.526
managed the transition away from
doing analytical and project work

00:15:20.550 --> 00:15:22.696
to actually having to be rainmakers

00:15:22.720 --> 00:15:25.256
and to manage relationships with clients.

00:15:25.280 --> 00:15:28.596
And so they had to kind of put on an image

00:15:28.620 --> 00:15:32.586
of something that they felt
they were not quite yet.